# composer.lock, package-lock.json and public/.htaccess are deliberately
# tracked, not ignored. The lockfiles are what make `composer install` and
# `npm ci` install the same versions on the server as were tested here —
# without them a deploy silently becomes an upgrade. public/.htaccess is
# what gives Apache its rewrite rules; lose it and every URL except / is
# a 404. Ignore a server's own stray .htaccess by path if one appears.
